  "content": "<h1>彩色副标题</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/haykam821/Colorful-Subtitles/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/haykam821/Colorful-Subtitles.svg?style=popout&label=github\" alt=\"GitHub 最新版本\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colorful-subtitles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?style=popout&label=curseforge&message=项目&color=6441A4\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhaykam.com%252flinks%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?style=popout&label=chat&message=discord&color=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p>根据声音类别更改副标题的颜色。</p>\n<p>彩色副标题需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 模组加载器</a>。</p>\n<h2>安装</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>从 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colorful-subtitles/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/haykam821/Colorful-Subtitles/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 下载彩色副标题。</li>\n<li>将下载的文件放入您的 <code>mods</code> 文件夹中。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>用法</h2>\n<p>安装此模组后，副标题将根据其声音类别自动显示不同的颜色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>音乐：深紫色</li>\n<li>唱片：深红色</li>\n<li>天气：青色</li>\n<li>方块：绿色</li>\n<li>敌对生物：红色</li>\n<li>中立生物：黄色</li>\n<li>玩家：金色</li>\n<li>环境音效：灰色</li>\n<li>语音：淡紫色</li>\n</ul>",
